          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.020:block:2",
          "start": 242
        },
        "quote": "(b) To develop and prepare the consolidated action plan each year and a five-year consolidated plan and other reports and submissions as required by HUD.",
